<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">Esther</book>
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="mt">Esther</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera a lal laiin (chu Ahasuera chu India aṭanga Ethiopia thlenga ram ṭhen za leh sawmhnih leh pasarih chunga lal a ni a) heti hi a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera a ram lalṭhutthlêng lal khua Susan-a a ṭhut lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a lal kum thum kum khân a mi liante zawng zawng leh a mite tân ruai a ṭheh a; Persia leh Media rama thuneitute, an ram ṭhen mi ṭhate leh mi liante chu an awm vek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a ram ropui tak rote leh a lal ropui nasatzia chu rei tak, ni za leh ni sawmriat zet a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chûng zawhah chuan mi lian leh mi tê lal khua, Susan-a lo tel zawng zawng tân lal in huan hung chhûng kawtlaiah lal chuan ni sarih zet ruai a ṭheh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />puan, a vâr te, a hring te, a dum pâwl te, lazai sin sen dukin tangkaraw khângah leh sailungvâr banahte an thlung a; rangkachak leh tangkaraw ṭhutphahte chu sailungvâr, a sen te, a vâr te, a eng te, a dum tea rem chungah an hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rangkachak novin uain chu an sem a (no chu chi hrang hrang, inang lo thluah a ni), lal chuan a ngah khawp a, uain chu a awm leng lung mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, uain chu dân angin an in a; tu mah tihluih an ni lo va, mi tinin an duh anga an tih ṭheuhna tûrin lal chuan a ina hotu zawng zawngte chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalnu Vasti pawhin Ahasuera lal inah chuan hmeichheho tân ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni sarih nî chuan lal rilru chu uain chuan a tihpuamsak ta a, pindan vêngtu pasarih, Lal Ahasuera hmaa rawngbâwl ṭhîn Mehumana te, Biztha te, Harbona te, Bigtha te, Abagtha te, Zethara te, Karkasa te chu Lalnu Vasti, a lallukhum khum chunga mipuite leh mi liante a hmêlṭhatzia inentîr tûra lal hmaa va hruai tûrin thu a pe a; a hmêl a ṭha hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalnu Vasti chuan pindan vêngtuten kal tûra lal thupêk an hrilh chu a hnial a; chuvângin, lal chu a thinrim ta hle mai a, a thinrim a alh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan thil hre mi mi fingte hnênah chuan (dân leh rorêl dân hria zawng zawngte chu chutiang chuan lalin a râwn ṭhîn rêng a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amah dâwltute chu Karsena te, Sethara te, Admatha te, Tarsisa te, Meresa te, Marsena te, Memukana te, Persia leh Media ram mi lian pasarih, lal hmêl hmu fotu, an rama amah hnaih ber ṭhînte an ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pindan vêngtuten an hriattîr si, Lal Ahasueran a tih anga a tih loh avângin Lalnu Vasti chungah chuan dân anga ti tûrin engtin nge kan tih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Memukana chuan lal leh mi liante hmaah chuan, “Lalnu Vasti chuan lal chungah chauh a tisual a ni lo va, mi lian zawng zawng leh Lal Ahasuera ram ṭhen zawng zawnga hnam tin chungah pawh a tisual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He lalnu thiltih hi hmeichhia zawng zawngin an han hre darh ang a, ‘Lal Ahasuera chuan Vasti a hmaa rawn hruai tûrin thu a pe a; nimahsela, a kal lo,’ tih thu a han than chuan an pasalte an hmuhsit phah mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, vawiinah ngei pawh hian Persia leh Media mi liannuho, lalnu thiltih hriate hian lal mi liante chungah an ti ve mai ang a. Chutichuan, inhmuhsitna leh thinurna nasa tak a chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal ṭha tih zâwng a nih chuan, lal thupêk than chhuak sela, Lalnu Vasti chu Lal Ahasuera hmaah lo kal tawh hauh suh se, tih thu hi tihdanglam tawh hauh loh tûrin Persia leh Media ram dân zîngah ziak ni sela; tin, lalin amah aia ṭha zâwk a lalnu nihna luahtîr sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, lal thupêk chu a ram zawng zawngah (zau teh mah sela) than chhuah a nih hunah chuan, an nupuiten a mi lian a mi tein an pasalte an pawisa ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu thu chuan lal leh mi liante chu a tilâwm hle a; tichuan, lal chuan Memukana thu ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalram zawng zawngah, ram tinah anmahni lehkha ṭheuhvin, hnam tin anmahni ṭawng ṭheuhvin mipain mahni in chhûng ṭheuhvah thu an nei tûr a ni tih thu a thawn ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnua Lal Ahasuera thinrim chu a lo daih hnu chuan, Vasti leh a thiltih leh a chungchânga thupêk chu a hre chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chhiahhlawh, a rawngbâwltute chuan a hnênah, “Lal tân nula hmêl ṭha zawn ni sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />lal pindan enkawltu Hegaia, hmeichhe enkawltu hnuaiah, Susana lal hmeichhe dah khâwmna inah nula hmêl ṭha zawng zawng ko khâwm tûrin lalin a ram chhûnga ram ṭhen zawng zawngah hotu ruat sela; tin, an intihthianghlimna tûrte pêk ni ṭheuh sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />lal tilâwmtu ber nula chu Vasti aiah lalnu ni sela,” an ti a. Tichuan, chu chuan lal chu a tilâwm a, chutiang chuan a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal khawpui Susan-ah chuan Juda mi, mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Mordekaia a ni a, Benjamin mi Kisa fa Simeia fapa Jaira fapa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran Juda lal Jekonia sala a hruai laia Jerusalem aṭanga hruai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pami fanu, Hadasi, Estheri an tih chu a enkawl seilian a; pa a nei lo va, nu a nei bawk si lo va. Nula chu a nalhin a hmêl a ṭha hle mai a; a nu leh a pa an thih hnuin Mordekaia chuan a fanu atân a awmpui ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal thupêk leh lal thuruat chu an lo hriata, nula tam tak, lal khawpui Susan-a Hegaia vênnaah an kal khâwm chiam lai chuan heti hi a ni a, Estheri chu lal inah hmeichhe vêngtu Hegaia vênnaah chuan an hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, nula chuan a tilâwm a, a duhsakna a chang a, lal in ata a chanvo leh a intihthianghlimna tûr chu a pe thuai mai a, nula pasarih pêk âwm deuh deuhte nên; amah leh a nulâtpuite chu hmeichhe awmna hmun ṭha berah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Estheri chuan eng chi nge a nih leh tute nge a laichînte a hriattîr hauh lo va; Mordekaia chuan hriattîr lo tûrin thu a pe tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Estheri chuan eng nge a tih ṭhina, engtin nge a awm tih hre tûrin Mordekaia chu ni tin hmeichhe awmna kawt hung chhûngah chuan a kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thla sâwm leh thla hnih hmeichhe tâna dân anga an chungchânga thiltih hnua Lal Ahasuera hnênah nulaho an kal hun a lo thlen chuan (chutiangah chuan an intihthianghlim hun a kim tawh ṭhîn a, hetiang hian an ti ṭhîn a ni, thla ruk chhûng murra hriakin an zût a, thla ruk dang leh chhûng rimtui leh hriak dangin an zût leh a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hetiang hian an kal ṭhîn a, lal ina luhpui tûrin hmeichhe awmna ata an duh apiang an pe ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlai lamah an kal a, a tûkah, hmei vêngtu, lal pindan vêngtu Saasgaza vên hmeichhe awmna pahnihnaah an lêt leh ṭhîn a; lalin a duha, an hming lama a kohte chauh lo chu lal hnênah an kal leh tawh ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mordekaia pami Abihaila fanu, a fanu atâna a awmpui Estheri chu lal hnêna a kal hun a thlen chuan, hmeichhe vêngtu, lal pindan vêngtu Hegaia ruat chauh lo chu eng mah a duh lo va. Estheri chu a hmu apiangte duh zâwng mi nih a kai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Estheri chu Lal Ahasuera lal inah thla sâwmna, Tebeth thlaah kum sarih a lal kumah an hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal chuan hmeichhe dang zawng zawng aiin a hmangaih a, nula dang zawng zawng aiin khawngaihna leh duhsakna a hlawh a; tichuan, lallukhum a khumtîr a, Vasti aiah lalnuah a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Estheri hmingin lal chuan a mi liante leh a mite tân ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a; a rama mite tân awm nî a khamsak a, lal tih âwm rêngin phal takin thilte a sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, nulaho an inkhâwm leh lai chuan Mordekaia chu lal kawt hung kawngkaah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mordekaia thupêk avângin Estheri chuan tute nge a laichînte leh eng chi nge a nih a la hriattîr lo fo va; Estheri chuan Mordekaia thu chu a awmpui laia a zâwm ṭhîn ang khân a la zâwm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, lal kawt hung kawngkaa Mordekaia a ṭhut lai chuan lal pindan vêngtu zînga mi pahnih Bigthana leh Teresa, kawngka vêng ṭhîntute chu an thinur a, Lal Ahasuera chungah kutthlâkna remchâng an zawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu thil chu Mordekaian a lo hria a, Lalnu Estheri chu a hrilh a; tin, Estheri chuan Mordekaia hmingin lal a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chumi thu chu an han chhui chiang a, chutiang chu a lo ni ngei tih an hriat chhuah chuan thingah an khai hlum ve ve a; chu chu lal kawl, lal chanchin ziakna buah an ziak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan Lal Ahasuera chuan Agag mi Hamedatha fapa Hamana chu a kaisântîr a, a chawisâng a, a mi liante zawng zawng aiin a ṭhut chungnuntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal kawt hung kawngkaa awm, a mite zawng zawng chuan Hamana chu an zah a, chibai an lo bûk ṭhîn a; chutianga tih tûrin lalin thu a pe a ni. Nimahsela, Mordekaia chuan a hmaa kûnin chibai a bûk duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal mite, lal kawt hung kawngkaa awm zawng zawngte chuan Mordekaia hnênah, “Engati nge lal thupêk i bawhchhiat?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, nî tin a hnêna an sawia a pawm chuan loh hnu chuan, Mordekaia thu chu a ngaimawh nge ngaimawh lo tih hriat nân Hamana chu an hrilh a, Juda mi a ni tih a lo hrilh tawh hlawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Hamanan Mordekaia a hmaa kûna chibai a bûk loh a han hriat chuan Hamana chu thinrimin a khat ta ṭeuh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, Mordekaia chung chauhva kut han thlâk chu eng mah thamah a ngai lo va, Mordekaia chi chu an hrilh tawh bawk si a; chuvângin, Ahasuera ram chhûng zawng zawnga Juda-ho, Mordekaia chipuite chu tihhlum vek a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera kum sâwm leh kum hnih a lal kum, thla khatna, Nisan thlaah Hamana hmaah ni tin, thla tin, thla sâwm leh pahnihna Adar thla thlengin Aienna ṭhum an vâwr reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hamanan Lal Ahasuera hnênah, “I ram ṭhen chhûng tinah hnam eng emaw, hnam dang nên inang lo, intihrang an awm darh nuaih a; an dânte chu hnam dangte dân nên a inang lo riau mai a, lal dân pawh an zâwm hek lo; chuvângin, chutiang awmtîr phal chu lal tân a manhla lo hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalin rem a tih chuan tihhlum vek tûr a ni tih ziak tlat ni sela; lal sum ina dah tûrin lal sum enkawltute kutah tangkaraw talent sângsâwm ka pe ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a zungbun a phawi a, Juda-te hmêlma Agag mi, Hamedatha fapa Hamana chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal chuan Hamana hnênah, “Tangka leh chûng mite pawh chu ṭha i tih ang anga tih tûra pêk i ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, thla khatna ni sâwm leh ni thum nîin lal lehkhaziaktute chu an ko va, Hamana thupêk ang chuan lal upate, ram ṭhen tin awptute, hnam tin puipate an thawn a, ram ṭhen tinah anmahni lehkhain, hnam tin anmahni ṭawng ṭheuhvin. Lal Ahasuera hminga thawn a ni a, lal zungbuna nem a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, lalram ṭhen tinah, Juda mi zawng zawngte chu, ṭhalai leh tar te, naupang tê tê te, hmeichhia te, ni khatah, thla sâwm leh thla hnihna, Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni thum nî takin tihboral veka, thah veka, tihchimih veka, an sum chu râllâka lâksak tûrin lehkha an thawn darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi nî atâna lo inpeih diam tûrin chumi thupêk chu ram ṭhen tina pêka hnam tin hnêna puan tûrin chumi lehkha chu an thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal thupêkin an kal hmanhmawhtîr a, thupêk chu lal khawpui Susan-ah an puang a. Lal leh Hamana chuan zu an in der der mai a; nimahsela, Susan khua chu a mangang hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng an thiltih zawng zawng chu a hriat chuan Mordekaia chuan a puan a pawt thlêr a, saiip puan leh vaivut a inbel a, khawlaiah a kal a, ring tak leh lungchhe takin a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal kawt hung kawngka bul thlengin a kal a, tu mah saiip puan sina lal kawt hung chhûng luh chu phal a ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal thupêk chu a thlenna ram tawh phawt maiah chuan Juda-te chu an ṭap ngawih ngawih a, chaw an nghei a, an chiau vawng vawng a, mi tam tak chu saiipah leh vaivut zîngahte an mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Estheri chu a nulate leh a pindan vêngtute chuan an va hrilh a; tichuan, lalnu chu a lungngai ta êm êm mai a, Mordekaia chu a saiip puan hlîpa, a sin tûrin a puan a thawn a; nimahsela, a lo duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Estheri chuan lal pindan vêngtu pakhat, amah vêngtu atâna ruat Hathaka chu a ko va, chûng chu eng nge nia, eng tizia nge ni tih hriat nân Mordekaia hnênah a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hathaka chu lal kawt hung kawngka zâwna mual zau laiah, Mordekaia hnênah chuan a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Mordekaia chuan a chunga thil lo thleng zawng zawng leh Juda-te tihhlumna tûra lal sum zînga dah tûra Hamanan tangka pêk a tiam zât chiah te a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Estheri entîr tûr leh a awmzia hrilhfiah tûr te leh lal hnêna dîlsak tûrin a tîr a, anmahni tihboralna tûra Susan-a an puan thupêk ziak chhâwn a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Hathaka chuan Mordekaia thuchahte chu Estheri a va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Hathaka chu Estheri chuan a lo bia a, “Lal chhiahhlawhte lalram ṭhen tina mite chuan, tu pawh, hmeichhia pawh, mipa pawh tihhluma a awm loh nâna lalin rangkachak tiang a lama a leknate chauh lo chu, lal hnêna a in chhûngrila lût chu tihhlum zêl tûr a ni tih dân awm chu an hre ṭheuh va; hei, ni sawmthum chhûng chu lal hnêna lût tûrin koh ka la ni lo va,” tiin Mordekaia hnêna sawi tûrin thu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Estheri thuchah chu Mordekaia an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mordekaia chuan Estheri a va chhântîr leh a, “Juda mi zawng zawngten an pumpelh loh tûr chu lal inah chuan i pumpelh dâwn bîk emaw tih inring suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûn ang huna i ngawih mai mai chuan, hmun danga Juda-te tân himna leh chhuahna a lo awm pawhin, nang leh i pa chhûngte chu kan boral ang. Lal nihna i lo chan hi hetih hun atân ngei hian a ni dâwn lâwm ni?” va ti tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Estheri chuan Mordekaia va chhâng leh tûr chuan a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Susan-a awm Juda mi zawng zawng ko khâwm vek la, keimah avângin chaw nghei ula, ni thum leh zan thum eng mah ei lo leh in lovin awm rawh u. Kei leh ka nulahote pawhin kan nghei ve ang a. Tin, dân lo angin lal hnênah ka lût ang a; tin, ka boral leh ka boral a ni mai ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mordekaia chu a kal a, Estherin thu a pêk zawng zawng ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni thum ni chuan heti hi a ni a, Estheri chuan a lal silhfên a inbel a, lal rorêlna in zâwn taka lal in hung chhûngah chuan a va ding a, lal chu lalṭhutthlênga a in luhna hawiin a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalnu Estheri chu lal kawt hung chhûnga a ding lalin a han hmuh chuan a chungah a lâwm a; lal chuan a rangkachak lal tiang ken chu Estheri lamah chuan a han lek a. Chutichuan, Estheri chuan a va hnaih a, lal tiang hmâwr chu a han khawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Lalnu Esther, eng nge i duh le? Eng nge dîl i duh? Ka ram zâtve hial pawh ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Estheri chuan, “Lalin ṭha a tih zâwng a nih chuan, vawiina a tâna ruai ka buatsaih ei tûrin lal leh Hamana lo kal teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Estheri sawi ang chuan Hamana chu han ko thuai rawh u,” a ti a. Chutichuan, lal leh Hamana chu Estheri ruai buatsaih ei tûr chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an uain ruaiah chuan lalin Estheri hnênah, “Eng nge i dîl dâwn? Pêk i ni ang. Eng nge ni i duh? Ka ram zâtve hial pawh pêk i ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Estheri chuan, “Ka thil dîl leh ka thil ngen chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />lal mittlung ka niha, ka thil dîl chu lalin pêk rem a tih zâwng a niha, ka thil ngen chu tih rem a tih zâwng a nih chuan, lal leh Hamana chu ka ruai buatsaih ei tûrin lo kal sela, lal tih ang chuan naktûkah hian ka ti mai ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hamana chu chumi ni chuan hlim tak leh lâwm takin a chhuak ta a; nimahsela, Hamana chuan lal kawt hung kawngkaa Mordekaia chu a hmaa a lo ding leh chechâng lo a han hmuh chuan, Mordekaia chungah chuan a thinur ta êm êm mai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amaherawhchu, Hamana chu a insûm hrâm hrâm a, a haw ta a; a ṭhiante leh a nupui Zeresi chu a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Hamana chuan a sum leh pai ropuizia te, fa a ngahzia te, lalin a kaisântîrna thil zawng zawng te, lal puipate leh a mite dang aia a tihchungnunnate chu an hnênah a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuti chauh pawh ni lovin, Hamana chuan, “Lalnu Estheri chuan le, a ruaiṭhehah chuan keimah chauh lo chu tu mah lal hnênah a teltîr lo va; naktûkah hian lal nên min sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda mi Mordekaia lal kawt hung kawngkaa ṭhu ka hmuh chhûng chuan hêng zawng zawng hi ka tân eng mah hnemhnânna a awm lo,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, a nupui Zeresi leh a ṭhiante zawng zawng chuan a hnênah, “Tawng sawmngaa sângin khai hlumna siamtîr la; tin, Mordekaia chu khai hlumtîr tûrin zîngah lal hrilh la, ruaiṭhehnaah chuan lal hnênah hlim takin kal mai rawh,” an ti a. Chu chuan Hamana chu a tilâwm a, khai hlumna chu a siamtîr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan lal chu a muhîl thei lo va; lal chanchin ziakna bu rawn la tûrin thu a pe a, a hmaah chuan an chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bigthana leh Teresa, lal pindan vêngtu, kawngkhâr vêngtu pahnihten Lal Ahasuera chunga kutthlâk an tum thu Mordekaian a lo hriattîr thu ziak chu an han hmu chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Chumi thu avâng chuan Mordekaia hian eng ang chawimawina leh ropuina nge a hmuh phah le?” a ti a. Lal chhiahhlawh, a rawngbâwl ṭhînte chuan, “Eng mah tihsak a hlawh lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Tu nge ni kawt hung chhûnga awm saw?” a ti a. Chumi lai chuan Hamana chu a khai hlumna siama Mordekaia khai hlumtîr tûr thu lal hnêna sawi tûrin, lal kawt hung pâwn zâwk chhûngah chuan a lo kal a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, lal kawt hung chhûnga awm chu Hamana a ni,” an ti a. Tin, lal chuan, “Lo lût rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hamana chu a lût a. Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Lalin mi chawimawi a duha chu eng tihsak nge ṭha ang le?” a ti a. Tichuan, Hamana chuan, “Lalin keimah aia a chawimawi duh zâwk tu nge awm ang?” a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Hamana chuan lal hnênah, “Lalin a chawimawi duh chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />lalin a inbel ṭhin lal puan te, lal chuan ṭhinna sakawr te, lallukhum, lalin a khum ṭhinte rawn lâksak ni sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, lalin a chawimawi duha chu thuam nân lal puan leh sakawr chu lal upa min ber kutah pêk ni sela, chuantîr sela, kawtthlêr fanpui sela, a hmaah chuan, ‘Lalin a chawimawi duha chu hetiang hian tih a ni ang,’ tiin puang zel sela,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan Hamana hnênah, “I sawi ang chuan lal puan leh sakawr chu va la thuai thuai la, lal kawt hung kawngkaa ṭhu ṭhîn, Juda mi Mordekaia chungah chutiang tak chuan va ti rawh; i sawi tâk zawng zawng kha hmaih awm hauh suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hamana chuan lal puan leh sakawr chu a va la a, Mordekaia chu a thuam a, kawtthlêrah a chuan vêltîr a, a hmaah chuan, “Lalin a chawimawi duha chu hetiang hian tih a ni ang,” tiin a puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mordekaia chu lal kawt hung kawngkaah chuan a lo kal leh a, Hamana erawh chu ngui takin inlukhuhin a in lamah a haw ta var mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Hamana chuan a nupui Zeresi leh a ṭhian zawng zawngte hnênah chuan a chunga thil lo awm dân engkim chu a hrilh a. Tichuan, a mi fingte leh a nupui Zeresi chuan a hnênah, “Tawhsual i tawhna Mordekaia chu Juda mi a nih chuan i chelh lo tawp ang a, a hmaah chuan i chesual ngei ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutia a hnêna an sawi lai mêk chuan lal pindan vêngtute chu an va kal a, Estheri buatsaih ruaiṭhehnaa kal tûr chuan Hamana chu hmanhmawh takin an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal leh Hamana chuan Lalnu Estheri ruai chu an kîlpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a ni hnih nia uain an in lai chuan lal chuan Estheri hnênah, “Lalnu Esther, eng nge i duh le? Pêk i ni ang. Eng nge ni i dîl dâwn? Ram zâtve hial pawh pêk i ni ang,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalnu Estheri chuan, “Aw lalpa, i mittlung ka niha, lal remtih zâwng a nih chuan, ka duh chu ka nunna mi zuahsak a ni a, ka dîl chu ka chipuite nunna zuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei leh ka chipuite chu tihborala thah vek tûra tih kan ni a. A hmei a pain bâwihah hralh tûra tih ni lek ila chu eng mah ka sawi lo tûr; mahse, tihmang tûr kan ni a, lal tân a hek hle ang, hmêlmapa chuan a rûl sêng lo vang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Ahasuera chu a ṭawng ta a, Lalnu Estheri hnênah chuan, “A rilru pawha chutiang han ti ngam chu tu nge a niha, khawiah nge a awm?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Estheri chuan, “Taitu leh hmêlma a ni, he mi sualpa Hamana hi a ni,” a ti a. Chutichuan, lalnu leh lalpa hmaah chuan Hamana chu a khûr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a zu ruai ṭhehna ata chu thinurin a tho va, lal huanah a lût a; tin, Hamana chu Lalnu Estheri hnêna a nunna zuahsak dîlin a ding a, lal chuan a chungah thil ṭha lo tih tum âwm taka a hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu lal huan ata chu uain ruai ṭhehna hmunah chuan a kal leh a, Hamana chu Estheri ṭhutna, ṭhutthlêngah chuan a tlu dêr mai a. Chutichuan, lal chuan, “He inah ka mit hmuh ngeiah lalnu chu a tilui elo maw?” a ti a. Chutia lal a ṭawng veleh chuan Hamana hmai chu an khuh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal pindan vêngtu zînga pakhat, lal hmaa lo awm Harbona chuan, “Ngai teh, lal tâna thu ṭha sawitu Mordekaia khai hlum nâna tawng sawmngaa sâng, Hamana siam sa diam khai hlumna Hamana inah a awm,” a ti a. Tin, lal chuan, “Chumiah chuan khai hlum rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mordekaia khai hlumna tûra a buatsaihah chuan Hamana chu an khai hlum ta a. Tichuan, lal thinurna chu a lo dai ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Juda-te hmêlma Hamana in chu Lal Ahasuera chuan Lalnu Estheri a pe a. Tin, Mordekaia chu lal hmaah a lo kal a; Estheri chuan a eng nge a nih a lo hrilh tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Hamana a lâksak, a zungbun chu a phawi a, Mordekaia a pe a. Tin, Estheri chuan Mordekaia chu Hamana in chhûng hotuah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Estheri chuan lal hmaah chuan thu a sawi leh a, a ke bulah a bawk a, mittui tla chungin Agag mi Hamana thil ṭha lo tih tum Juda-te chunga a remruat chu tihbo a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan rangkachak tiang chu Estheri lamah chuan a han lek phei a. Chutichuan, Estheri chu a tho va, lal hmaah chuan a ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Lal ṭha tih zâwng a niha, a mittlung ka niha, lal ngaiha a dika, a lâwm zâwng ka nih chuan, Agag mi Hamedatha fapa Hamana remruat lehkha, lalram ṭhen zawng zawnga mi Juda-te tihboral vek tûr tih a ziak chu tih leh loh tûrin ziak ni sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engtin nge ka chipuite chunga thil ṭha lo lo thleng han hmuh chu ka tuar zawh ang? Engtin nge ka laichînte boral han hmuh chu ka tuar zawh ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Ahasuera chuan Lalnu Estheri leh Juda mi Mordekaia hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh u, Juda-te chunga a kut a thlâk avângin Hamana in chu Estheri ka pe e, amah pawh chu an khai hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te hnênah i duh ang takin lal hminga thawn tûr lehkha ziak la, lal zungbuna nemin châr rawh; lal hminga ziak leh lal zungbuna nem leh châr chu tu mân an tidanglam thei lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal lehkhaziaktute chu chumi lai la la, thla thumna, Sivan thla ni sawmhnih leh ni thum nîah chuan an ko va, Mordekaia thupêk ang chuan Juda-te hnênah te, hotute hnênah te, India aṭanga Ethiopia thlenga ram ṭhen hrang za leh sawmhnih leh pasariha ram awptute leh puipate hnêna thawn tûrin lehkha an ziak a, ram ṭhen tinah chuan anmahni lehkha ṭheuhvin, hnam tin anmahni ṭawng ṭheuhvin, Juda-te hnênah pawh an lehkha leh an ṭawngin an thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera hmingin a ziak a, lal zungbunin an nem a, lehkha chu sakawr an phurhtîr a, ama vulh ṭhiau, lal tâna chhawr ṭhin sabengtung chak mi chunga chuangin an tlânpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chu lehkhaah chuan lal chuan Juda-ho khaw tina awmte chu inpun khâwma lo invêng tûrin a ti a; eng mi pawh, khawi rama mi pawh, anmahni leh hmeichhia leh naupangte bei tûra lo thawk apiang chu lo beia that chimit vek tûr leh, an neih zawng zawng pawh rawk tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera ram ṭhen zawng zawng chungah he thil ti tûra Juda-te tâna ni ruat chu thla sâwm leh thla hnihna, Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni thum ni, Juda zawng zawng thah vek tûra ruat ni chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi lehkhaa thupêk chu, chumi nia an hmêlmate chunga phuba an lâk theihna tûra Juda-te chu inpeih diama an lo awm theih nân ram ṭhen zawng zawnga thawn chhuaha, mi zawng zawng hnêna puan tûr, tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmanhmawh takin lal thupêkin lal tâna chhawr ṭhin sabengtung chak mi chunga chuang lehkha tlânpuitute chu an chhuak a; tin, thupêk chu lal khawpui Susan-a puan chhuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Mordekaia chu lal puan, a dum pâwl leh a vâr inbelin, rangkachak lallukhum ropui tak leh puanzaisîn kawrfual sen duk inbelin lal in ata chu a chhuak a; Susan khua chu an au dur dur a, an lâwm êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Juda-ho chuan êng te, lâwmna te, hlimna te, chawimawina te an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal thupêk leh lal thu tihtlûk thlenna ram ṭhen leh khua apiang chu an lâwmin an hlim êm êm a, ruai te an ṭheh a, awmni an kham a. Tin, chûng ram mite zînga tam tak chu Juda-ah an insiam a; Juda-te chu an lo hlauh tak avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, thla sâwm leh thla hnihna, Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni thum ni, Juda-ho hmêlmaten an chunga rorêl an beisei ni, lal thupêk anga an tih ni tûr chu a lo hnai ta a. Nimahsela, a leha lingin Juda-ten anmahni hawtute chunga ro an rêlna a lo ni ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera ram ṭhen zawng zawnga Juda-hote chu, an chhiatna zawngtu chunga kut thlâk tûrin an khuaahte chuan an pung khâwm a. Tu mân an chelh ta lo va, anmahni chu mi zawng zawngin an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi ram ṭhena mi ṭha zawng zawng te, hotu te, ram awptu te, lal hnathawktute chuan Juda-te chu an ṭanpui ta a, Mordekaia an hlauh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mordekaia chu lal ina mi ropui tak a ni a, a hming chu an ram ṭhen zawng zawngah a thang ta bawk a; Mordekaia chu a ropui ta deuh deuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan an hmêlmate chu khandaihin an sâm a, an that a, an tiboral a, anmahni hawtute chungah an duh ang angin an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal in Susan-ah chuan Juda-ten mi zanga an that a, an tiboral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Hamedatha fapa, Juda-te hmêlma Hamana fapate sâwm - Parsandatha te, Dalphona te, Aspatha te, Poratha te, Adalia te, Aridatha te, Parmasta te, Arisaia te, Aridaia te, Vaizatha te chu an tihlum a; râllâk sum erawh chu an khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan lal khawpui Susan-a an thah zât chu lal hmaah an rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan lalnu Estheri hnênah, “Juda-te chuan lal khawpui Susan-ah hian mi zanga leh Hamana fapate sâwm an that a, an tiboral ta. Lalram ṭhen dangah chuan engtin tak ti ang maw? Eng nge i dîl dâwn le? Pêk i ni ang. Eng nge i la duh leh dâwn? Tih a ni ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Estheri chuan, “Lalin rem a tih chuan, Susan-a Juda-te hian vawiina thupêk ang bawk hian naktûkah pawh ti sela. Hamana fapa sâwmte chu khai hlumnaah khai kân ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan chutianga ti tûr chuan thu a pe a; Susan-ah thupêk chu an puang a, Hamana fapa sâwmte chu an khai kâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Susan-a Juda-te chu Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni li ni pawhin an pung khâwm a, Susan-ah mi zathum an that a; nimahsela, râllâk sum chu an khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Juda dang lalram ṭhen tina awmte pawh an pung khâwm a, inchhanhim tûrin ṭan an khawh a, an hmêlmate lakah râlmuangin an awm a, anmahni hawtute zînga mi sîngsarih leh sângnga an that a; nimahsela, râllâk sum chu an khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni thum nîah chu chu an ti a; tin, ni sâwm leh ni li ni chuan an châwl a, ruaiṭheh ni leh hlimna nîah an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Susan-a Juda-te erawh chu chumi ni, ni sâwm leh ni thum leh ni sâwm leh ni li ni chuan an pung khâwm a; ni sâwm leh ni nga ni chuan an châwl a, ruaiṭheh ni leh hlimna nîah an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, kulh nei lo khuatea Juda-te chuan Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni li ni chu hlimna leh ruaiṭhehna ni leh, ni ropui leh ei tûr inpêk tawnna nîah an siam ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Mordekaia chuan chûng thil chu a ziak a, Lal Ahasuera ram ṭhente chhûnga Juda-te zawng zawng, lamhnai leh lamhlaa mite lehkha a thawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adar thla ni sâwm leh ni li ni leh ni sâwm leh ni nga ni chu kum tin awmnia hman tûrin thu a pe a; chumi ni chuan Juda-te chu an hmêlmate laka râlmuanga an awm tâk avâng leh, chumi thlaa lungngaihna chu an tân lâwmnaa a chan tâka, ṭahna ni chu ni lâwmawm taka a lo chan tâk avângin; tin, ruaiṭheh ni leh hlimna ni leh chanvo inthawn ni leh mi retheite thilpêk ni atâna siam tûrin thu a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, an lo tih ṭan tawh sa ang leh Mordekaian an hnêna a thawn angin Juda-te chuan tih an tum ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Agag mi Hamedatha fapa Hamana, Juda-te hmêlma chuan Juda-te chu tiboral tûrin a phiar a, Aienna a lo siam tawh diam si a, chu chu anmahni timang tûr leh tiboral tûra aienna a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nimahsela, lal hmaa chu thu chu a lo thlen chuan suahsualthlâk taka Juda-te a phiarna chu ama lû chungah a lêt ang a, amah leh a fapate chu khai kân tûr an ni tih lehkhain thu a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, chu aienna avâng chuan chûng nite chu Aien nite an ti a. Chutichuan, chûng lehkha thu zawng zawng avâng te, chûng thil lo thleng an hmuh avâng te, an chunga thil lo thleng avângte chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda-te chuan anmahni chhanah leh an thlahte leh anmahni rawn bêl apiangte chhanah thlasik anga khêl lovin, chûng nite chu, lehkhathawna chuang ang leh a hun ruat ang tak chuan kum tin awmnia hmang tûrin an ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tin, chûng nite chuan chhuan zawng zawnga chhûngkaw tinah, ram ṭhen tinah, khaw tinah an hre rengin awmniah an hmang tûr a ni; tin, chûng Aien nite chu Juda-te zingah ngaihthah mai tûr a ni lo va, chumi hriat rengna pawh an thlahteah a tâwp mai tûr a ni lo an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abihaila fanu, Lalnu Estheri leh Juda mi Mordekaia chuan Aien chungchânga lehkhathawn pahnihna chu tinghet tûrin thu nei takin an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Ahasuera ram ṭhen za leh sawmhnih leh pasariha Juda-ho zawng zawng hnênah chuan Mordekaia chuan ṭha takin lehkha a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Juda mi Mordekaia leh Lalnu Estheri thupêk ang leh, anmahni ngei pawhin anmahni leh an thlahte tâna chaw nghei leh ṭah ni tûra an lo ruat angin, hêng Aien nite hi a hun ruatah an serh tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aien kût hman dân chu Estheri thupêkin lehkhaah ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Ahasuera chuan a ram leh tuifinriat thliarkârte chu chhiah a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thiltihtheihna leh a chaknaa a thiltih zawng zawng leh Mordekaia ropuina chungchâng, lalin a tihchungnun dân thu kimchang takin Media leh Persia lalte lal lai chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda mi, Mordekaia chu Lal Ahasuera dawttu a ni a, Juda-te zingah chuan mi ropui tak, a unaute tam tak lung tiawia, a chipuite ṭhatna zawnga, a hnampuite zawng zawng hnêna thlamuanna thu sawi ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
